# Everything is left out of the build context, then what the Dockerfile copies
# is let back in. A new directory at the root, a cache of chips or a run's
# outputs, then never reaches the container image by accident.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!configs/
!examples/
!docker/data/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.DS_Store
